#. i18n: file: dialogs/EditFilterDialog.ui:41
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, mainLabel)
#: rc.cpp:1235
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Edit the filter for finding tracks with specific attributes, e.g. a track "
